     "titulo": "The year's festivals",
     "texto": [
      "**Natal** (Christmas), **Páscoa** (Easter), **Carnaval** (Carnival) and **Ano Novo** (New Year).",
      "To wish: **Feliz Natal** (merry Christmas), **Boas Festas** (happy holidays), **Bom Ano Novo** (happy New Year)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Popular saints",
     "texto": [
      "In June, in Lisbon, there are **festas de Santo António** (Saint Anthony festivals): **sardinhas** (sardines) are eaten in the street and **manjericos** (basil pots) are given away.",
      "In **Comem-se sardinhas**, **sardinhas** is the grammatical subject, so the verb is in the plural. The agent is not specified. Compare: **Vive-se bem aqui** (one lives well here), with the verb in the singular."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
